From bd40e490a68ef99299f12f586ec540317aeb73fb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Adam Rutkowski <hq@mtod.org>
Date: Mon, 22 Jun 2026 17:18:25 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Pages report: breakdown by hostname (#6452)

* Support additional pages breakdown by hostname ("URL" in user-facing terminology)

* Optionally include hostname in external links

* Configure page reports broken down by hostname

* Support optional extra dimensions

* Add react routes for hostname pages breakdowns

* Allow explicit search dimension override

In case of pages broken down by hostname, we still want to
search through pages, regardless of the order supplied

* Support multiple dimensions in breakdown index

* Implement react logic/UI to support pages report additional breakdown

* Add e2e tests

* Format

* Format e2e

* Apply hostname+page filter on URL breakdown mode page click

* Format

* Make minor visual improvements

- Add checkmark to selected option in popover menu
- Improve spacing of popover and sizing of icons

---------

Co-authored-by: Sanne de Vries <sannedv@protonmail.com>
